{"id":"word:hebrew:H7892","type":"word","title":"שִׁיר","subtitle":"H7892 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a song ; abstractly, singing","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שִׁיר (H7892) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 91 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שִׁיר (shîyr) means a song ; abstractly, singing First listed occurrence: 1Chr 6 16."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שִׁיר","transliteration":"shîyr","pronunciation":"sheer","strong":"H7892","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7892","partOfSpeech":"n-m n-f","forms":["שִׁ֥יר","שִׁ֗יר","שִׁ֣יר","שִֽׁיר","שִׁ֖יר"],"morphs":[["HNcbsa",29],["HNcbsc",24],["HTd/Ncbsa",15],["HRd/Ncbsa",3],["HNcbsc/Sp3ms",3],["HR/Ncbsc",3],["HC/R/Ncbpa",2],["HC/R/Ncbsa",2],["HC/Td/Ncbsa",1],["HNcbpc/Sp2ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a song ; abstractly, singing","usage":"musical(-ick), × sing(-er, -ing), song.","full":"H7892. shiyr שִׁיר 77 noun masculine song (Late Hebrew id. ; so Ecclus 40:21 +); — ׳שׁ absolute Judg 5:12 +, construct 2Chr 29:27 +; suffix שִׁירִי Psa 28:7 , etc.; plural שִׁירִים 1Chr 13:8 ; Song 1:1 ; שִׁרִים Gen 31:27 ; Prov 25:20 ; suffix שִׁרֶ֫יךָ Amos 5:23 , etc.; &#8212; 1 lyric song , + מָשָׁל 1Kin 5:12 , opposed to קִינָה Amos 8:10 ; joyous Gen 31:27 (J) Isa 30:29 ; ׳שׁ עגבים Ezek 33:32 ; triumphal Judg 5:12 ; love song Song 1:1 (twice in verse) (title הַשִּׁירִים שִׁיר ), Psa 45:1 ( יְדִידֹת שִׁיר ); noisy Amos 5:23 ; Ezek 26:13 , in drunken revels Isa 24:9 , compare 23:16 ; ׳שׁ כסילים Eccl 7:5 ; not for sorrow Prov 25:20 ; Psa 137:3 (twice in verse); הַשִּׁיר בְּנוֺת Eccl 12:4 songstresses (probably birds). 2 religious song , in worship, || תפלה Psa 42:9 ; usually praise, בשׁיר הלל 69:31 ; אֲהוֺדֶנּוּ מִשִּׁירִי 28:7 ; וְהוֺדוֺת תְּהִלָּה שִׁרִ Neh 12:46 ; י ׳שׁיר Psa 137:4 ; 2Chr 29:27 ; חדשׁ שׁיר Isa 42:10 (fresh outburst), + 6 t., see חָדָשׁ ; in Psalm-titles, שׁיר 46:1 , compare 26:1 ; המעלות שׁיר pilgrim songs Psa 120:1 14t. (see II. מַעִַלָה p.752); with מִמְוֺר 48:1 12 t. (see ׳מִז p. 274); שִׁיר מַשְׁכִּיל 45:1 ( ׳שׁ originally alone in all except 30:1 ; 92:1 ; 108:1 , see Br JBL xviii (1899), 138 ). 3 specifically song of Levitical choirs, with musical accompare , 1Chr 6:16 ; 6:17 ; 13:8 (so read also || 2Sam 6:5 for ᵐ5 בְּרוֺשִׁים, Th and modern, compare ׳ב ), 1Chr 25:6 ; 25:7 ; 2Chr 23:18 ; 29:28 ; Neh 12:27 ; (ה)שׁיר כלי instrument to accompany song 1Chr 15:16 6 t. (see כְּלִי 2b ); compare Amos 6:5 . שִׁירָה noun feminine song (plural ירות [ שׁ ] Ecclus 39:15); &#8212; absolute ׳שׁ Exod 15:1 9 t.; construct שִׁירַת Isa 5:1 ; 23:15 ; plural construct שִׁירוֺת Amos 8:3 (read ᵐ5 שָׁרוֺת Hoffm ZAW iii (1883) We and others); — song, ode , Exod 15:1 (E), 2Sam 22:1 = Psa 18:1 ; Deut 31:19 (twice in verse); 31:21-22 , 30 ; 32:44 ; Num 21:17 (E) Isa 5:1 ; 23:15 .","rootNote":"or feminine שִׁירָה ; from 7891 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 6 16","keyReferences":["1Chr 6 16","1Chr 6 17","1Chr 13 8","1Chr 15 16","1Chr 16 42","1Chr 25 6","1Chr 25 7","1Kgs 5 12"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":91,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 6 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁ֖יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/שִּׁ֔יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 13 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְ/שִׁירִ֤ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁ֛יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 42","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁ֣יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 25 6